        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/07/apple-expands-refurb-store-with-rare-m5-macbook-pro-configs-apple-tv-4k-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/10/macbook-pro-m5-14-inch.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has added a host of new products to its official <a href=\"https://apple.sjv.io/9VrXeY\">Certified Refurbished Store</a> this week. New M5 MacBook Pro models, the Studio Display XDR, high-end M5 MacBook Air configurations, and more are available.</p>",
        "type": "Technology",
