        "title": "Apple TV’s surprise hit series is making the jump to theaters for one night only",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/06/apple-tvs-surprise-hit-series-is-making-the-jump-to-theaters-for-one-night-only/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/widows-bay-s1-finale-rhys-couch.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While Apple TV has found success at the box office, Apple usually reserves theaters for its movies, not its series. However, one hit show from Apple this year is coming to the cinema for one night only in select venues across the country: <em>Widow’s Bay</em>.</p>",
